WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,660 --> 00:00:04,450
Thank you, classmate Chen An

2
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:05,450
She has a lot of supplies there

3
00:00:05,450 --> 00:00:09,270
You will definitely survive if you join

4
00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:10,270
But the room is too small

5
00:00:10,270 --> 00:00:11,270
She is still a boy

6
00:00:11,270 --> 00:00:12,270
If I go too

7
00:00:12,270 --> 00:00:14,270
Will that happen?

8
00:00:14,270 --> 00:00:17,360
What did you say before going downstairs?

9
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:18,360
Safety is most important

10
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:21,360
I actually fought hard to break my bag.

11
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:23,940
I want to put in more effort

12
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:24,940
It won’t snow next time

13
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:26,940
You are more valuable than that cloth bag

14
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:29,830
I know Zi Yao

15
00:00:29,830 --> 00:00:30,830
Relying on others

16
00:00:30,830 --> 00:00:32,830
Go to the toilet and fill it up for Jiang Lai to sell.

17
00:00:32,830 --> 00:00:33,830
Leave it to me

18
00:00:33,830 --> 00:00:34,830
Since the beating

19
00:00:34,830 --> 00:00:36,830
This woman is much more sensible

20
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:37,830
Clear division of labor

21
00:00:37,830 --> 00:00:39,830
This is thin vitality

22
00:00:39,830 --> 00:00:45,100
Wait until your physical strength is fully restored

23
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:47,130
Let's go outside the community
